  <metadata>
    <name>Oslotrippelen 2026</name>
    <desc>Unofficial combination of the bundled Oslo 2026 marathon, half marathon and 10K, in race order. Original track coordinates and elevation are unchanged. Separate tracks omit untimed transfers between races. Component files are listed as MIT in the course catalogue; original attribution fields are No / None. Compare with the organizer before printing.</desc>
